version 0.11
procurement adapter-front
role primary

# Which parts the panel is bought with. The left side is the BOM line key -- the generic and the
# values it was given -- and the right side is the part that is bought (spec/procurement.md).
#
# The jack: a 2.0 mm plug that carries 2 A and survives 6 V. Xun Pu's DC-005-A200 states 2 A and
# 30 V on its own page, which is the number this selection is compared against.
selections
  dc-jack-th 2.0mm 2A 6V -> dc-005-a200
# The indicator: a green LED whose peak wavelength is 565 nm. Lite-On's LTST-C190GKT is a 565 nm
# green LED rated 30 mA. The colour is a class and the wavelength is a bin, so this row is compared
# for equality, not for "at least" (ADR-0077 D3).
  led-indicator-0603 green 565nm -> ltst-c190gkt
